# Build products.  The RECORDED outputs ship: sysdump.out, run1.txt,
# run2.txt and sysdump_dis.txt, so that every claim in the course is
# checkable on a machine that never ran the benchmark -- which is the whole
# reason the harness takes a path argument and defaults to sysdump.out.
# The BINARY does not ship, because a committed executable is a file nobody
# can review and one that is wrong on the next gcc.
sysdump
*.o
__pycache__/
